# Submodules of the DDA umbrella repo.
# EVERY gitlink must be mapped here — an unmapped gitlink 404s on GitHub and makes
# `git submodule` / `git clone --recursive` abort (report §12.1). Push a submodule's commits
# to its own remote BEFORE committing a new pointer here.
# The pipeline (adda_python_scripts/) is NOT a submodule: it is tracked directly in this repo
# with its full history (report §13). Third-party ADDA trees are not tracked at all and are not
# submodules either — fetch/build instructions: docs/DDA-manual.md §3.5, report §11.
[submodule "arts-sspdb-interface"]
	path = arts-sspdb-interface
	url = https://github.com/m-brath/arts-sspdb-interface.git
	branch = main
